# Dockerfile.dev copies nothing (compose bind-mounts the repository at run time),
# so the build context is empty: secrets (.env files, supabase/.env,
# supabase/signing_keys.json), node_modules and the private media/raw never
# reach the Docker daemon.
#
# If a Dockerfile ever needs files, allowlist exactly those with "!path" lines
# below. Never allowlist .env*, supabase/.env, supabase/signing_keys.json,
# media/raw or node_modules.
*
